      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2003 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We report on two cases of acute coronary stent thrombosis after early withdrawal of different competitive inhibitors of the platelet glycoprotein IIb/IIIa receptor, eptifibatide and tirofiban. Differences in pharmacokinetics between different types of glycoprotein IIb/IIIa receptor blockers and a potential rebound prothrombotic effect with the use of these antiplatelet drugs are reviewed."
      },
